text.en:
Fill in the two active branches alongside the no-op.
```vhdl
case lsb_pair is
    when "01"   => acc <= acc + m_ext;
    when "10"   => acc <= acc - m_ext;
    when others => acc <= acc;
end case;
```

text.es:
Completa las dos ramas activas junto a la de no-operación.
```vhdl
case lsb_pair is
    when "01"   => acc <= acc + m_ext;
    when "10"   => acc <= acc - m_ext;
    when others => acc <= acc;
end case;
```
